  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ezingo Fund for the Central African Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Central African Republic Multi-Partner Trust Fund (Ezingo) mobilizes strategic resources for integrated humanitarian responses to ongoing national and cross-border stabilization, recovery, and security challenges. Approaches are comprehensive and coherent, fusing humanitarian action with development finance mechanisms in a push to identify sustainable solutions to the current crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
